DESCRIPTION:Full-day community meeting bringing together genetics and genomics researchers.\n\nKeynotes: Mirte Bosse (Wageningen), Pete Hollingsworth (RBGE), Didier Trono (EPFL)\nEMS300 lecture: Wendy Bickmore\n\nPlus talks from Dan McQueen, Ross Fitzgerald, Emily Humble, Chumeng Zhu, Kyle Ewart and many more.\n\nLink: https://onehealthgenomics.ed.ac.uk/communitymeeting2026\n\n⚠️ Register by 1st June: https://forms.office.com/e/pksbT9quJX
